# ------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT
# ------------------------------------------------------------
#
# This file is not a substitute for secret scanning.
#
# A secret accidentally committed to Git must be considered
# compromised even if it is subsequently removed from the
# working tree.
#
# Production secrets must be revoked and rotated immediately.
#
# Sensitive information must never be committed merely because
# it matches an ignored pattern incorrectly or because the
# repository is private.
#
# .gitignore protects the working tree.
# It does not provide confidentiality.
#
# ============================================================
# ============================================
# SECRETOS Y CONFIGURACIÓN (CRÍTICO)
# ============================================

# Variables de entorno (NUNCA subir secretos)
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env.*.local
.envrc
.env.backup

# Configuración con secretos
